{
  "request": "I run licensing at a district council. Draft an application form for street trading consent, for people who want to sell hot food or goods from a pitch, stall or vehicle in our consent streets. We need the applicant's details, the business, where and when they want to trade, what they'll sell, the stall or vehicle, food registration for food traders, two passport photos and a declaration about unspent convictions. The fee is in our separate fee schedule.",
  "title": "Application for street trading consent",
  "description": "Use when someone applies to the council for consent to trade from a pitch, stall or vehicle in a consent street: who they are, where, when and what they will sell, their unit, and their declaration.",
  "maxPages": 3,
